Package: conn4R
Type: Package
Title: Connect 4 with an AI Engine in 'C++' via 'Rcpp'
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Vicente", "Castellar Sebastiá",
           email = "vic.sebastia@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implementation of Connect 4 with an artificial intelligence based
    on the minimax algorithm with alpha-beta pruning, a transposition table and
    static position evaluation. The main engine is compiled in 'C++' via 'Rcpp'
    for maximum performance. The R functions provide the game interface,
    position entry and analysis, visualization and game utilities.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
URL: https://github.com/vcastellar/conn4r
BugReports: https://github.com/vcastellar/conn4r/issues
Imports:
  ggplot2,
  Rcpp
LinkingTo:
  Rcpp
Suggests:
  testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
